, supply chain, manufacturing, and integrated services, plus a portfolio of power and cooling products. Over time, we have built differentiated scale and expertise across both technology-driven and regulated markets, enabling us to support customers with increasingly complex product, infrastructure, and compliance requirements. We partner with customers across a diverse set of industries including data center, healthcare, industrial, automotive, communications, and lifestyle.","zh":"該公司擁有全套專業能力，包括設計和工程、供應鏈、製造和整合服務，以及電源和冷卻產品組合。隨著時間的推移，我們在技術驅動和受監管的市場上建立了差異化的規模和專業知識，使我們能夠為客戶提供日益複雜的產品、基礎設施和合規性要求。我們與多個行業的客戶合作，包括資料中心、醫療保健、工業、汽車、通訊和生活方式。"},{"en":"Reflecting the evolution of our portfolio and operating model, as of March 31, 2026, Flex's three operating and reportable segments were as follows, to serve distinct customer needs and end markets:","zh":"截至 2026 年 3 月 31 日，偉創力的三個營運和可報告部門如下，反映了我們的產品組合和營運模式的演變，以滿足不同的客戶需求和終端市場："}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"In fiscal year 2026, our ten largest customers accounted for 45% of net sales. No customer accounted for greater than 10% of the Company's net sales in fiscal year 2026.","zh":"2026財年，我們的十大客戶佔淨銷售額的45%。沒有客戶占公司2026財年淨銷售額的10%以上。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The contract manufacturing services market is competitive. Flex competes against numerous domestic and foreign manufacturing service providers, as well as current and prospective customers.","zh":"合約製造服務市場競爭激烈。偉創力與許多國內外製造服務提供者以及現有和潛在客戶競爭。"},{"en":"We believe the principal competitive factors in the contract manufacturing services market are quality and range of services; design and technological capabilities; cost; location of sites; supply chain resiliency; sustainability; and responsiveness and flexibility.","zh":"我們認為合約製造服務市場的主要競爭因素是服務品質和範圍；設計和技術能力；成本;地點的位置；供應鏈彈性；永續性；以及反應能力和靈活性。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"Integrated Technology Solutions ITS","val":11109000000,"zh":"綜合技術解決方案 ITS"},{"name":"Regulated Manufacturing Solutions RMS","val":10191000000,"zh":"監管製造解決方案 RMS"},{"name":"Cloud Power Infrastructure CPI","val":6614000000,"zh":"雲端電力基礎設施CPI"}],"total":27914000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-03-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":13820000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"Asia","val":8401000000,"zh":"亞洲"},{"name":"MX","val":6994000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"Europe","val":5693000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"US","val":5186000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":4494000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"MY","val":2967000000,"zh":"我的"},{"name":"SG","val":194000000,"zh":"新加坡"}],"total":27914000000}},"peers":["SANM","JBL","CLS","NTAP","CIEN"]}}